option.shadowDistance.comment	 	= The shadow render distance controls how far away \
	terrain can potentially cast or receive real-time shadows.\n\n\
	Terrain outside of this distance will cast and receive approximate, static \
	shadows based on skylight.\n\n\
	Lower distances mean that less terrain will be rendered, improving frame \
	rates.\n\n\
	The actual shadow render distance is capped by the View Distance setting \
	in Video Settings..
